  "translation": "Na man i kirap long go, em na pilges bilong en na boi bilong en; na wantok bilong en — papa bilong dispela meri — i tok long em: Lukim plis, de i go klostu long apinun; slip long nait hia, plis; lukim, san i go daun na de i pinis; slip hia, na bel bilong yu bai i swit, na tumora yupela kirap earli long rot bilong yupela, na yu ken go long haus tel bilong yu.",
